{
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "tfm2_valorant_omen": {
        "name": "Omen",
        "skill": "Dark Cover: a shadow dome 100000 across (radius 50000) for 10s, placed anywhere on the map. Nobody outside sees in or through it; someone inside sees only within 15000 and nothing outside (their teammates' sight still counts). Shooting or casting from inside reveals you for 0.5s. Two charges: one comes back on the cooldown (25s), the other is bought (200 credits). He can re-smoke a spot before it fades. Where it goes: the place he's about to ult into, only when no bush or smoke there hides his arrival (a smoke warns the enemies, so it's the second option); on himself when he's low and chased; on a teammate who is; around a big objective (the enemies' way in when his team is taking it, half the pit when the enemies are on it: the far half from his team, so the near half stays in sight to pick them off); over an enemy he can reach with the shotgun or his step (step in, shotgun out); in a fight, over the enemy hitting hardest, kept off his own teammates. In a gank he never smokes the enemy being ganked: behind them (their way home and their help), or over his teammates. Enemies check a smoke in their way before walking past it: Omen could be in any of them. Passive, Buy Phase: credits instead of items (start 1000, kill +300, assist +150, +200 every 20s alive, +50 for every kill his team gets, death +400; a death costs his armor, he keeps his gun). Kills of enemies he blinded or that stood in his smoke count as his assists. He buys at his spawn, or anywhere when no enemy is near, the gun first (armor only with the Vandal's price left over, until he has one): the best one he can pay for (Sheriff from 800, Spectre from 1600, or the Judge shotgun from 1850 against close fighters, Vandal from 2900, the Operator only when rich, from 5500), then armor and the second smoke from what is left. Guns: Classic (free, 30000 range), Sheriff (800: 38000, hard-hitting, slow), Spectre (1600: 28000, fast, light), Judge (1850: 18000, shotgun: up to 3x point blank, falling to 0.7x, the spread clips whoever stands by the target), Vandal (2900: 42000, +30% damage, +15% speed), Operator (4700: 80000, +200% damage, very slow). Armor is a shield only buying refills: light 400 (12% max HP), heavy 1000 (25%). The gun shows over his head, and his money under it.",
        "skill2": "Shadow Step range: 75000. Omen cannot move during Shadow Step or ultimate channeling. Accepted destinations stay fixed; enemy interruptions still cancel. Paranoia and Shadow Step have independent 7-second base cooldowns. Paranoia blinds champions on its committed line, including allies; the blind lasts 5 seconds up close, falling to 3 seconds at maximum range. Shadow Step channels for 0.6 seconds and teleports up to 75,000 units. Athlete Ego, Judgement, Positioning, control speed, accuracy, dodge and play-style stats guide confirmed-blind follow-ups, firing positions, escapes and rotations.",
        "ult": "From the Shadows: channel for 2 seconds, then teleport to a fixed location anywhere on the map. A targetable shade marks the destination; destroying it cancels the teleport. Athlete decisions consider remote ganks, tower defence, objective reinforcement, channel survival and useful follow-up. Cooldown 80 seconds."
      },
      "tfm2_valorant_raze": {
        "name": "Raze",
        "skill": "Paint Shells: cluster grenade. Buy Phase, as Omen: one free charge returns every 8 seconds and a second charge costs 300 credits. 120000 throw range. Main blast 85 + 75% Attack, then four smaller blasts (20 + 20% Attack), at most two secondary hits per enemy. Boom Bot is an additional native ability: one free charge every 18 seconds, a second for 300 credits, one destructible bot, 70 + 70% Attack blast. Grenade/rocket self-damage is 15% before mitigation. Free starting Bucky and 1000 credits; save for a useful Judge or Vandal upgrade before buying extra utility or armour, with Omen's credit income; bought charges are lost on death and free charges return at once, weapons persist. No mastery. All 13 pinned athlete attributes influence decisions and execution only. Main radius 30000; four cluster centres scatter diagonally by 30000 per axis, each with 18000 radius. Grenades reflect off solid walls and map edges; the warning follows their actual landing. Boom Bot rolls along the thrown direction, bounces off walls, and acquires visible enemies in its forward cone within 36000 units, retaining that visible target within 65000. These skills deal physical damage. Enemy skill damage is exactly 3x the original integer result after Attack scaling and falloff, before armour. Self-damage retains the original unbuffed formula. Mod Power, weapon bonuses and item Attack are read once through current stats.",
        "skill2": "Blast Pack: one free charge returns every 6 seconds and a second costs 200 credits, as Omen's second smoke. Detonate to add a radial launch impulse; air-strafe with bounded directional acceleration, steering at most 155 degrees from the flight heading (she turns instead of reversing), and retained momentum. A second satchel adds another impulse. Armed after 0.5 seconds: 30 + 25% Attack and enemy knockback within 28000. Satchels have 40 HP and expire after 5 seconds without exploding. Raze stays targetable. Terrain, roots and movement-blocks constrain travel. Actual airborne flight grants 15% incoming damage reduction, lingering after landing or interruption for 3/5.25/7.5/9.75/12 seconds with 1/2/3/4/5+ visible enemy champions within 80000; none nearby grants no extension; death clears it; no crowd-control immunity. Judge now deals 3x basic damage through 10000, falling to 0.7x at 20000; Raze saves for it when a close entry is viable; otherwise she saves for Vandal. Packs stick to ground, wall faces and solid constructions. Launch impulse 200000; air acceleration 600000, preserving momentum and speed caps. These skills deal physical damage. Enemy skill damage is exactly 3x the original integer result after Attack scaling and falloff, before armour. Self-damage retains the original unbuffed formula. Mod Power, weapon bonuses and item Attack are read once through current stats. Domed launch: the centre adds lift only and keeps existing horizontal velocity. At 14000 offset, launch outward at 200000 with 48 ticks of fresh airtime; force fades to zero at the 28000 edge. Air acceleration is 600000. Landing defence snapshots champions once, never stacks, and later arrivals do not refresh it. Bucky: 18000 range, 300% AD through 8000 falling linearly to 60% at 18000, -40% weapon attack speed, physical primary attack with shotgun splash. Offensive AI entries require survival and champion follow-up or an exit; manual commands keep normal mechanical freedom.",
        "ult": "Showstopper: ultimate unlock required; equip for 0.7 seconds and fire within 6 seconds. Cooldown 50 seconds from firing; an equip that is interrupted or never fired costs nothing. Ground endpoint or first unit/wall impact. Maximum 240 + 150% Attack; continuous falloff to 25% at 50000 radius. Travel up to 120000 starting at 120000 and accelerating to 600000 units/second over 0.3 seconds. Firing gives a short grounded recoil slide or an airborne third boost opposite the shot. Actual airborne flight grants 15% damage reduction; ground recoil does not. Grenade/rocket self-damage remains 15% before normal mitigation. No homing, free charges or animation-cancel skips. Warns the predicted impact area; enemies attempt to escape. Surviving enemy champions, minions and summons are pushed outward over 0.2 seconds, with terrain and immunity respected. These skills deal physical damage. Enemy skill damage is exactly 3x the original integer result after Attack scaling and falloff, before armour. Self-damage retains the original unbuffed formula. Mod Power, weapon bonuses and item Attack are read once through current stats."
      }
    }
  }
}
